Still worrying about looking for Competitors? Still worrying about Competitors' analysis? Still tired of heavy and meaningless Competitors' Documents?

CompetitorX is a magic box that help you collect and analyze Competitors for your Product. In CompetitorX, you can:
1. Add Competitors in one click and track the status of Competitors at all times;
2. Competitive Strategy Analysis:
    - Positioning Analysis;
    - Competitor's Situation Analysis;
    - Ability Analysis, Find out Competitor's Weakness;
    - Make Competitive Strategy;
3. Analyse Competitor from Product:
    - Analyze Competitors through a five-dimensional radar chart;
    - Organize the Unique Selling Points of Competitors;
    - Organize the distinction Features between Competitors and your Product;
    - Organize screenshots of Competitors and call them at any time;
4. Intelligent analysis of the competitive strength of Competitors through Personae;
5. Support night mode (dark theme) to protect your eyes.

Whether you are a product manager, a Boss, an indie developer or a newcomer who is learning to get started, the CompetitorX will be your right hand when doing Competitor analysis, getting rid of redundant forms, documents and various screenshot folders. Meaning finishing work, a lightweight app can help you get everything!

